# L §7.1 (round 6): "the integer of a code (nominal 12, §2.2): part of the code's name, not a figure" is allowed inline.
# periodic(r, month, nominal 12) = (1 + r/12)^(12 · 1/12) - 1 = r/12 = 0.12/12 = 0.01 (L §3.3).
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
input r: rate
def p: num = periodic(r, month, nominal 12) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  r = 12 %/year

ask a: p law 2026-06-30
=== expect
a: 0.01
  law date 2026-06-30, cut 2026-12-31
